orm=\"translate(32698.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>1 mole of potassium dichromate reacts with 6 moles of ferrous sulphate. Thus, number of moles of Mohr's salt required per mole of dichromate is 6.<p></p></p>"}]}